## Installation

### 1. Install Python
Download from: https://python.org
✅ Check "Add Python to PATH" during install

### 2. Install Ollama
Download from: https://ollama.com
Then open terminal and run:
```bash
ollama pull llama3.2
```

### 3. Clone & Run
```bash
git clone https://github.com/omegabolt256/papermate.git
cd papermate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python run.py
```

---

## Usage

### Create a Project
```
> N
Project name: My Research
```

### Search Papers
```
> 1
Search: liposomal drug delivery cancer
> da    (add all results)
> y     (download PDFs)
```

### View & Read Papers
```
> 2
> V
Paper number: 1
> O     (opens PDF)
> C     (copy citation)
> F     (open folder → drag to Zotero)
```

### Chat with AI
```
> 3
You: What do these papers say about nanoparticle size?
```
If your papers don't have the answer, it auto-searches internet.

### Zotero Sync
```
> 6
> 1    (configure)
API Key: [from zotero.org/settings/keys]
User ID: [from same page]
> 2    (sync library)
```

### Export
```
> 5
> 1    (BibTeX)
> 2    (CSV)
> 5    (Full Report)
```

